WEBVTT

00:00:30.183 --> 00:00:31.136
<v><b>S:</b></v> Can I help you?

00:00:31.754 --> 00:00:34.769
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes. Do you have these in an eleven?

00:00:37.855 --> 00:00:39.972
<v><b>S:</b></v> Just a minute. I’ll go and check.

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:41.571
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you.

00:00:51.796 --> 00:00:52.620
<v><b>S:</b></v> Here you are.

00:00:53.393 --> 00:00:56.190
These are an eleven. Do you want to try them on?

00:00:56.691 --> 00:00:59.698
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, thanks. I’m sure they’ll be fine.

00:01:03.542 --> 00:01:04.862
<v><b>S:</b></v> That will be eighty pounds.

00:01:06.447 --> 00:01:09.611
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh, it says ninety-five ninety-nine.

00:01:09.726 --> 00:01:11.171
<v><b>S:</b></v> Yes, they’re on sale.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:14.060
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh. Great!

00:01:25.807 --> 00:01:26.350
Thank you.

00:01:26.881 --> 00:01:27.736
<v><b>S:</b></v> Thank you.

00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:29.018
<v><b>B:</b></v> Bye.

00:01:29.484 --> 00:01:30.210
<v><b>S:</b></v> Bye bye, now.

00:01:42.159 --> 00:01:43.035
<v><b>S:</b></v> Can I help you?

00:01:43.716 --> 00:01:45.958
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I just bought these.

00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:47.879
<v><b>S:</b></v> I remember.

00:01:49.673 --> 00:01:50.711
Is there a problem?

00:01:51.197 --> 00:01:54.786
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, they’re too big.

00:01:55.936 --> 00:01:57.084
<v><b>S:</b></v> What size are they?

00:01:57.889 --> 00:02:01.159
<v><b>B:</b></v> They’re an eleven. I take a US eleven.

00:02:01.905 --> 00:02:03.905
<v><b>S:</b></v> Oh, right.

00:02:04.651 --> 00:02:07.715
American sizes are always one size larger.

00:02:08.683 --> 00:02:11.492
You need a UK ten. Just a minute…

00:02:17.193 --> 00:02:19.776
I’m sorry, but we don’t have those in a ten.

00:02:20.841 --> 00:02:26.084
But we do have these and they’re the same price, or you can have a refund.

00:02:27.475 --> 00:02:29.177
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’ll take this pair, then.

00:02:31.935 --> 00:02:33.343
<v><b>S:</b></v> Oh, do you have the receipt?

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.247
<v><b>B:</b></v> Sure.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:40.329
Here you go.

00:02:42.969 --> 00:02:43.565
<v><b>S:</b></v> Great.

00:02:46.401 --> 00:02:46.911
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you.